Firebrat 1.7.2
- Listen while it converts: open a book once its first sections are narrated and playback carries on as more finish
- Pause and resume conversions; progress is saved after every section, so an app update or restart no longer loses it
- Stopped or failed conversions can be resumed
- A resumed novel keeps its character voices
- New in 1.7: EPUB/MOBI/AZW books, an on-device queue, a Cast screen, a free LLM key guide
